    "A 7-day ritual with focus, wins, and open protections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein 7-Tage-Ritual mit Fokus, Erfolgen und offenen Schutzmaßnahmen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un ritual de 7 días con foco, logros y protecciones pendientes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un rituel de 7 jours : focus, réussites et protections en cours."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un rituale di 7 giorni con focus, successi e protezioni aperte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chosen obligation with open eyes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine bewusst eingegangene Verpflichtung."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una obligación elegida con los ojos abiertos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un engagement pris en connaissance de cause."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un impegno scelto a occhi aperti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A deliberate, low-drama money move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine bewusste, unaufgeregte Finanzentscheidung."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un movimiento de dinero deliberado y sin dramas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une décision financière réfléchie et sans drame."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una mossa finanziaria deliberata e senza drammi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A foreseeable compensation choice with clear upside and downside.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine absehbare Vergütungsentscheidung mit klaren Vor- und Nachteilen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una decisión salarial previsible con ventajas y riesgos claros."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un choix de rémunération prévisible, avec des avantages et des risques clairs."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una scelta retributiva prevedibile, con vantaggi e rischi chiari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A health issue keeps me from working for six weeks": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Gesundheitsproblem hält mich sechs Wochen vom Arbeiten ab"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un problema de salud me impide trabajar seis semanas"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un problème de santé m’empêche de travailler six semaines"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un problema di salute mi tiene fermo dal lavoro per sei settimane"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A household shock driven by someone else’s employer decision.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Schock für den Haushalt, ausgelöst durch die Entscheidung eines fremden Arbeitgebers."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un golpe para el hogar causado por la decisión de otra empresa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un choc pour le foyer, causé par la décision d’un autre employeur."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uno shock familiare causato dalla decisione di un altro datore di lavoro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A known load you opted into.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine bekannte Belastung, für die du dich entschieden hast."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una carga conocida que elegiste asumir."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une charge connue que tu as choisie."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un carico noto che hai scelto di accettare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plan for every shock": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Plan für jeden Schock"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un plan para cada golpe"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un plan pour chaque choc"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un piano per ogni shock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A risk you chose": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein bewusst gewähltes Risiko"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un riesgo que elegiste"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un risque que tu as choisi"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un rischio che hai scelto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short look at the last 7 days — shocks logged, protections taken, one focus ahead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein kurzer Blick auf die letzten 7 Tage: Schocks, Schutzmaßnahmen und ein Fokus für die nächste Woche."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un repaso breve de los últimos 7 días: golpes registrados, protecciones hechas y un foco por delante."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un bref retour sur les 7 derniers jours : chocs notés, protections prises, un focus pour la suite."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uno sguardo rapido agli ultimi 7 giorni: shock registrati, protezioni fatte e un focus per la prossima settimana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sudden jump in your biggest fixed cost squeezes savings and forces a rushed move.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein plötzlicher Sprung bei deinen größten Fixkosten zehrt die Ersparnisse auf und erzwingt einen überstürzten Umzug."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una subida repentina de tu mayor gasto fijo se come los ahorros y obliga a mudarte con prisas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une hausse soudaine de ta plus grosse charge fixe grignote ton épargne et force un déménagement précipité."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un aumento improvviso della tua spesa fissa più grande erode i risparmi e costringe a un trasloco affrettato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tighter loop for spotting fragile spots and limiting damage from surprise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein engerer Kreislauf, um Schwachstellen zu erkennen und Schäden durch Überraschungen zu begrenzen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un ciclo más ágil para detectar puntos frágiles y limitar el daño de las sorpresas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une boucle plus serrée pour repérer les points fragiles et limiter les dégâts des imprévus."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un ciclo più stretto per individuare i punti fragili e limitare i danni delle sorprese."
          }
        }
      }
    },
