            "value": "Annuale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't predict the next shock. You can be ready for it. Black Swan helps you spot where you're fragile and protect yourself before it hits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den nächsten Schock kannst du nicht vorhersagen. Aber du kannst bereit sein. Black Swan zeigt dir deine Schwachstellen und hilft dir, dich zu schützen, bevor es passiert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No puedes predecir el próximo golpe, pero puedes estar preparado. Black Swan te ayuda a ver dónde eres frágil y a protegerte antes de que llegue."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de prédire le prochain choc. Mais tu peux t’y préparer. Black Swan t’aide à repérer tes points fragiles et à te protéger avant qu’il arrive."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non puoi prevedere il prossimo shock, ma puoi farti trovare pronto. Black Swan ti aiuta a vedere dove sei fragile e a proteggerti prima che arrivi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You logged events — awareness is the first buffer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast Ereignisse erfasst – Bewusstsein ist der erste Puffer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registraste eventos: ser consciente es el primer colchón."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as noté des événements : la prise de conscience est la première réserve."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai registrato eventi: la consapevolezza è il primo cuscinetto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all set": {
